{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n210\nrevolutionaries, and then to July 5, when they touched\nrock  bottom.\nA new period is coming in. The victory of the counter-\nrevolutionaries is making the people disappointed with the\nSocialist-Revolutionary and Menshevik parties and is paving\nthe way for the masses to adopt a policy of support for the\nrevolutionary  proletariat.\nWritten  on  July  26  (August  8),  1917\nPublished  in  Rabochy  i  Soldat\nPublished  according  to\nNos.  11  and  12,  August  4  and  5,  1917\nthe  manuscript", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "210", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.32, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "revolutionaries, and then to July 5, when they touched", "x": 11.11, "y": 9.53, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "rock  bottom.", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 17.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "A new period is coming in. The victory of the counter-", "x": 13.9, "y": 13.39, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "revolutionaries is making the people disappointed with the", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Socialist-Revolutionary and Menshevik parties and is paving", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.27, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the way for the masses to adopt a policy of support for the", "x": 11.11, "y": 19.2, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "revolutionary  proletariat.", "x": 11.11, "y": 21.14, "w": 34.1, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 11.7, "y": 25.02, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "on", "x": 20.18, "y": 25.02, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 23.38, "y": 25.02, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "26", "x": 28.27, "y": 25.07, "w": 2.13, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(August", "x": 31.41, "y": 25.02, "w": 7.51, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"